<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Badges</title>

    <style>
        *{
            margin:0;
            padding:0;
            box-sizing:border-box;
            font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        }

        body{
            background:#0d1117;
            color:#f0f6fc;
            display:flex;
            justify-content:center;
            align-items:center;
            height:100vh;
        }

        .container{
            width:90%;
            max-width:650px;
            background:#161b22;
            border:1px solid #30363d;
            border-radius:12px;
            padding:40px;
            text-align:center;
            box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
        }

        h1{
            font-size:2rem;
            margin-bottom:15px;
        }

        p{
            color:#8b949e;
            line-height:1.6;
            margin-bottom:25px;
        }

        .notice{
            background:#21262d;
            border-left:5px solid #f0b429;
            padding:15px;
            border-radius:8px;
            color:#f0f6fc;
        }

        .emoji{
            font-size:50px;
            margin-bottom:20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">

    <div class="emoji">🏅</div>

    <h1>Badges Temporarily Unavailable</h1>

    <p>
        Our badge system is currently unavailable while we make improvements.
        We're working to bring it back as soon as possible.
    </p>

    <div class="notice">
        <strong>Notice:</strong><br><br>
        Badges cannot be viewed or claimed at this time.
        Thank you for your patience and understanding.
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
